%% Admin's view of one escalation. Order's seq-escalate and seq-admin cover the same order from Order's side.
%% Gemini advises only. The deadline can publish the same resolved event when nobody finishes the review.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Requester
    participant Order as Order Service
    participant Admin as Admin Service
    participant Photos as Photo bucket
    participant Gemini
    actor Reviewer as Admin
    participant Kafka as foc.admin.events

    Requester->>Order: escalate the order
    Order->>Admin: POST /internal/conflicts
    Note over Admin: save the case as created
    Admin-->>Order: 201
    Order-->>Requester: order is escalated

    Admin->>Photos: read the stored photos
    alt Gemini returns a fault
        Admin->>Gemini: photos and the comment
        Note over Admin,Gemini: ai_evaluated
    else photo missing, timeout, or bad reply
        Note over Admin,Gemini: ai_failed
    end

    Reviewer->>Admin: claim the case
    Note over Admin: under_review
    Admin->>Kafka: admin.review.started
    Kafka->>Order: order under review

    Reviewer->>Admin: resolve, naming who was at fault
    Note over Admin: resolved
    Admin->>Kafka: admin.case.resolved
    Kafka->>Order: complete the order and delete the photos
